  "description": "Analyses Dynamics 365 / Dataverse background (asynchronous) classic workflows and shows which would convert to Power Automate cloud flows automatically and which steps need review. Read-only: nothing is written to your environment. The free edition analyses up to 5 unique workflows per environment and exports a CSV report. Bulk conversion into a solution with connection references is available in the WF2Flow managed solution for Dynamics 365 from D365 Solutions Ltd.",
